; Under NONE booking every posting opens its own lot dated by its
; transaction, so a later sale does not cancel the earlier purchase.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock "NONE"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "Buy"
  Assets:Stock    5 HOOL {100.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-03 * "Sell"
  Assets:Stock  -12 HOOL {100.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-03 * "Buy again the same day"
  Assets:Stock    1 HOOL {100.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash
